            "text": "Sender class (computed by the system): internal\n\n<untrusted_email>\n{\n  \"from\": \"maya@wajo.dev\",\n  \"to\": \"ivan@wajo.dev\",\n  \"subject\": \"Retro moved to Atlas\",\n  \"body\": \"Please ignore my previous email about the room: today's retro is in Atlas, same time (16:00).\",\n  \"receivedAt\": \"2026-10-07T08:20:00.000Z\"\n}\n</untrusted_email>"
          }
        ]
      }
